{"data": [{"author_id": "1931415459225845761", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:52:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119186196878487867"], "id": "2119186196878487867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119184637427601770", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我们知道人民的每个账号在一天之内跳出弹窗广告多少次，人民从弹窗广告跳转到旗舰店或(每天)消费多少，人民从广告跳转互联网企业去购物是否有付费？以及付费多少，我们不要求人民实名，也不要求绑定银行卡，只要求人民绑定微信=用于收款，可以换绑微信，根据规则，一人实名能注册5个微信号… https://t.co/Gv8FD6o2gJ", "url": "https://x.com/louise88889/status/2119186196878487867"}, {"author_id": "2029233769409024000", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:05:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119174394954002460"], "id": "2119174394954002460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Penang just cancelled 27,734 camera-issued parking fines.\nDrivers had 1 minute to pay. It did not hold up.\nLPR owners: give at least 10 minutes of grace, audit every flagged plate, and make appeals easy. https://t.co/ubmu8JSO4u", "url": "https://x.com/winsparking/status/2119174394954002460"}, {"author_id": "1931415459225845761", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:55:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119187054907085002"], "id": "2119187054907085002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119184637427601770", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我们投资的APP肯定会监督人民资金的流向和消费记录，防止人民利用AI伪造付费截图或视频来骗取补贴，我们能看到付费金额，后台有消费数据，但是，为了保护隐私，每个APP没有实名和银行等信息，一部手机没有注册100个APP的可能性，根据补贴资金计算权重，不行… https://t.co/Gv8FD6nurb", "url": "https://x.com/louise88889/status/2119187054907085002"}, {"author_id": "869768913709481986", "created_at": "2026-11-07T20:56:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119172274066784281"], "id": "2119172274066784281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 314, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "为什么说，对现代文明贡献最大的，是英国、法国、德国和美国这四个国家？\n\n如果把现代文明比作一座大厦，那么英国奠定了制度与工业的基础，法国确立了自由平等的价值理念，德国筑牢了科学与教育的根基，美国则推动技术创新与现代体系的全球化。 https://t.co/W6ybRzluZX", "url": "https://x.com/yibingsg/status/2119172274066784281"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1931415459225845761", "name": "Louisepmg", "username": "louise88889"}, {"id": "2029233769409024000", "name": "Wins Parking | Parking Technology & Management", "username": "winsparking"}, {"id": "869768913709481986", "name": "Fairice", "username": "yibingsg"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2119187054907085002", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlzcigh46dcnfo5e9y7jaw72fdkt", "oldest_id": "2119172274066784281", "result_count": 4}}
